{
  "pid": "self-hard-04",
  "source": "selfmade",
  "difficulty": "hard",
  "title": "多泵均衡运行与主备切换（数组遍历与迟滞阈值）",
  "requirements": "写一个功能块 FB，管理5台并联泵的主备选择与迟滞。只验 leadPump、lagPump、runningCount，不推断其余泵的启停输出。\n1. runHours[1..5] 为非负整数小时；全场按（运行小时、泵号）升序排序，同工时小泵号优先。demand 裁剪到0..5，runningCount等于裁剪后的需求。\n2. 需求为0时主备都清零；重新产生正需求时按排序初选主泵。需求1时备泵为0。\n3. 正需求期间保留当前主泵。rotated 按电平逐拍读取：只有请求有效且当前主泵工时比全场最短工时泵多严格超过50小时，才将最短者设为新主泵。差49或50小时均不得切换；无请求不得切换。\n4. 需求至少为2时，仅在初选、从1台升至需备泵或换主时，从其余泵中选排序最小者作备泵；其余拍保持原备泵。主备必须不同，数组仅用1..5下标。\n5. 独立用例各自初始化；标注相同 sequence 组名的用例在新实例中连续运行，各组互相独立并全部计分。",
  "variables": [
    {
      "name": "demand",
      "data_type": "INT",
      "description": "需求泵台数 0..5（超出请先按边界裁剪）",
      "direction": "input",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "runHours",
      "data_type": "ARRAY[1..5] OF LINT",
      "description": "各泵累计运行小时数（只读）",
      "direction": "input",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "leadPump",
      "data_type": "INT",
      "description": "当前主泵号 1..5，0 表示尚未选定",
      "direction": "output",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "lagPump",
      "data_type": "INT",
      "description": "当前备用泵号 1..5，0 表示无",
      "direction": "output",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "runningCount",
      "data_type": "INT",
      "description": "实际运行泵台数",
      "direction": "output",
      "fields": []
    },
    {
      "name": "rotated",
      "data_type": "BOOL",
      "description": "本周期存在轮换请求（输入，由维护逻辑置位）",
      "direction": "input",
      "fields": []
    }
  ],
  "target_pou": "FUNCTION_BLOCK",
  "specs": [
    {
      "sid": "S1",
      "text": "实际需求台数等于裁剪到0..5的需求。",
      "ltl": "G(runningCount=LIMIT(0,demand,5))",
      "kind": "safety",
      "verified_by": "bounded_checker"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S2",
      "text": "主备泵必须是不同的泵（备泵为 0 表示只有一台）。",
      "ltl": "G(lagPump <> 0 -> leadPump <> lagPump)",
      "kind": "safety",
      "verified_by": "bounded_checker"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S3",
      "text": "主泵状态迟滞、严格50小时边界、备泵保持及平局顺序用独立和连续用例校验。",
      "ltl": "",
      "kind": "data",
      "verified_by": "simulation"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S4",
      "text": "需求为 0 时不得有任何泵处于选中状态（当周期即成立）。",
      "ltl": "G(demand <= 0 -> leadPump = 0 & lagPump = 0)",
      "kind": "safety",
      "verified_by": "bounded_checker"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S5",
      "text": "需求为 0 时运行台数必须为 0。",
      "ltl": "G(demand <= 0 -> runningCount = 0)",
      "kind": "safety",
      "verified_by": "bounded_checker"
    },
    {
      "sid": "N10-S1",
      "text": "11.10补充：运行台数严格等于裁剪后的需求：小于 0 取 0，大于 5 取 5，否则等于需求。",
      "ltl": "G(((demand < 0 -> runningCount = 0) AND (demand > 5 -> runningCount = 5) AND ((demand >= 0 AND demand <= 5) -> runningCount = demand)))",
      "kind": "safety",
      "verified_by": "test_trace_audit"
    },
    {
      "sid": "N10-S2",
      "text": "11.10补充：正需求时主泵编号在 1..5；需求 1 台无备泵，需求至少 2 台时备泵编号在 1..5 且与主泵不同。",
      "ltl": "G(((demand > 0 -> (leadPump >= 1 AND leadPump <= 5)) AND (demand = 1 -> lagPump = 0) AND (demand >= 2 -> (lagPump >= 1 AND lagPump <= 5 AND leadPump <> lagPump))))",
      "kind": "safety",
      "verified_by": "test_trace_audit"
    },
    {
      "sid": "N10-S3",
      "text": "11.10补充：原主泵有效且需求为正时，如主泵发生变更，原主泵在本拍的工时须比新主泵严格多于 50 小时。",
      "ltl": "G((prev(leadPump >= 1 AND leadPump <= 5) AND leadPump >= 1 AND leadPump <= 5 AND leadPump <> prev(leadPump) AND demand > 0) -> runHours[prev(leadPump)] - runHours[leadPump] > 50)",
      "kind": "safety",
      "verified_by": "test_trace_audit"
    },
    {
      "sid": "N10-S6",
      "text": "11.10补充：正需求期间，若上拍已有主泵且本拍没有轮换请求，主泵必须保持。",
      "ltl": "G((NOT rotated & prev((leadPump <> 0)) & demand > 0) -> leadPump = prev(leadPump))",
      "kind": "safety",
      "verified_by": "test_trace_audit"
    },
    {
      "sid": "N10-S7",
      "text": "11.10补充：初选时选全场（工时，泵号）最小者；有主泵时，如果本拍有轮换请求且原主泵比全场最短工时严格多于 50 小时，本拍必须换成全场最小者。",
      "ltl": "G(((demand > 0 AND leadPump >= 1 AND leadPump <= 5 AND (NOT prev(leadPump <> 0) OR (rotated AND prev(leadPump >= 1 AND leadPump <= 5) AND runHours[prev(leadPump)] - MIN(runHours[1],runHours[2],runHours[3],runHours[4],runHours[5]) > 50))) -> ((runHours[leadPump] < runHours[1] OR (runHours[leadPump] = runHours[1] AND leadPump <= 1)) AND (runHours[leadPump] < runHours[2] OR (runHours[leadPump] = runHours[2] AND leadPump <= 2)) AND (runHours[leadPump] < runHours[3] OR (runHours[leadPump] = runHours[3] AND leadPump <= 3)) AND (runHours[leadPump] < runHours[4] OR (runHours[leadPump] = runHours[4] AND leadPump <= 4)) AND (runHours[leadPump] < runHours[5] OR (runHours[leadPump] = runHours[5] AND leadPump <= 5)))))",
      "kind": "safety",
      "verified_by": "test_trace_audit"
    },
    {
      "sid": "N10-S8",
      "text": "11.10补充：需要备泵时，在初选、换主或实际运行台数上升的当拍，以新主泵为排除项，选择其余泵中（工时，泵号）最小者。",
      "ltl": "G(((demand >= 2 AND lagPump >= 1 AND lagPump <= 5 AND (leadPump <> prev(leadPump) OR runningCount > prev(runningCount))) -> ((leadPump = 1 OR (runHours[lagPump] < runHours[1] OR (runHours[lagPump] = runHours[1] AND lagPump <= 1))) AND (leadPump = 2 OR (runHours[lagPump] < runHours[2] OR (runHours[lagPump] = runHours[2] AND lagPump <= 2))) AND (leadPump = 3 OR (runHours[lagPump] < runHours[3] OR (runHours[lagPump] = runHours[3] AND lagPump <= 3))) AND (leadPump = 4 OR (runHours[lagPump] < runHours[4] OR (runHours[lagPump] = runHours[4] AND lagPump <= 4))) AND (leadPump = 5 OR (runHours[lagPump] < runHours[5] OR (runHours[lagPump] = runHours[5] AND lagPump <= 5))))))",
      "kind": "safety",
      "verified_by": "test_trace_audit"
    }
  ],
